rem Races (Гонки)
rem https://acmp.ru/index.asp?main=task&id_task=746
rem Count 4-cycles. C = A*A holds the
rem common-neighbour counts c(u,v); every
rem cycle is two opposite pairs, so
rem cycles = sum over u != v of
rem C(c, 2), divided by 4.

use io
use text
use cli
use sequences
use linalg

arg Input text = "4 6
1 2
2 3
3 4
4 1
1 3
2 4"

Txt = Input split "\r" join " "
Txt = Txt split "\n" join " "
Tok = Txt split " "
Nums = (Tok (Tok not equal "")) integer
N = Nums 0
M = Nums 1
Ends = (Nums (2 till (2 * M + 2))) - 1
Us = Ends ((0 till M) * 2)
Vs = Ends (((0 till M) * 2) + 1)

Flat = array shape (N * N) fill 0
Ones = array shape M fill 1
Flat ((Us * N) + Vs) = Ones
Flat ((Vs * N) + Us) = Ones
Adj = Flat reshape N N

Common = (Adj matpow 2) reshape #
Pairs = (Common * (Common - 1)) // 2
Diag = Pairs ((0 till N) * (N + 1))
Ans = ((Pairs sum) - (Diag sum)) // 4
Ans print
